@startuml
title 004 題組與多填空 - 類別圖

class Activity {
  stage
  questions
  worksheet
  exportAnchorState
}

abstract class Question {
  questionId
  displayOrder
}

class SingleQuestion
class GroupQuestion

class AnswerSlot {
  placeholderNumber
  sourceRowAtImport
}

class WorksheetReference {
  spreadsheet
  worksheet
}

class ExportManifest {
  sheetId
  initial coordinates
  target question and slot mapping
  dimension metadata IDs
  prewrite and intended values
}

class ExportAnchorState {
  status: NONE | PREPARED | CONFIRMED
}

class GuidedNotesService {
  pendingRepeat
}

abstract class AcceptedSubmission {
  groupId
  questionId
  receivedOrder
  acceptedAt
  locked
}

class SingleSubmission {
  answerText
}

class GroupSubmission {
  answers
}

class SubAnswer {
  placeholderNumber
  answerText
}

class QuestionResult {
  winningGroupId
  winningReceivedOrder
}

class BuzzerResultsService {
  submissions
  winners
}

Question <|-- SingleQuestion
Question <|-- GroupQuestion
Activity "1" o-- "0..100" Question
Activity "1" --> "0..1" WorksheetReference
Activity "1" *-- "1" ExportAnchorState
ExportAnchorState "1" *-- "0..1" ExportManifest
GuidedNotesService "1" --> "0..1" ExportManifest : uncertain repeat
GroupQuestion "1" *-- "2..20" AnswerSlot
AcceptedSubmission <|-- SingleSubmission
AcceptedSubmission <|-- GroupSubmission
AcceptedSubmission "*" --> "1" Question : questionId
GroupSubmission "1" *-- "2..20" SubAnswer
QuestionResult "0..1" --> "1" AcceptedSubmission : winner
QuestionResult "0..1" --> "1" Question
BuzzerResultsService "1" o-- "0..*" GroupSubmission
BuzzerResultsService "1" o-- "0..*" SingleSubmission
BuzzerResultsService "1" o-- "0..*" QuestionResult

note right of AcceptedSubmission
每組每題最多一筆完整有效提交；
單題保留原始一字串提交形狀。
end note

note right of GroupSubmission
只適用 GROUP：包含全部 2 至 20 個
依佔位符編號排序的子答案。
end note

note bottom of GroupQuestion
佔位符編號由 1 開始且連續；
子題數可因題組而異。
end note

note right of AnswerSlot
首次匯出依目前佔位符定位；
再次匯出需驗證原坐標與題目／子題對應。
end note

note right of ExportManifest
首次寫入前保留；同批建立 PROJECT key=sb004 列欄標記。
結果未確認時以標記和已輸入值讀回驗證。
活動結束後保留至活動替換或程序重啟。
end note
@enduml
